---
/**
 * About page — Artist biography (bilingual Chinese + English).
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionTitle from '../components/SectionTitle.astro';
import avatarSrc from '../assets/images/avatar.jpg?url';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about the artist Yuezi — background, practice, and contact."
>
  <section class="section about-section">
    <div class="container-narrow">

      <!-- Avatar -->
      <div class="about-avatar-wrapper reveal">
        <img
          src={avatarSrc}
          alt="Yuezi"
          class="about-avatar"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <SectionTitle
          label="Biography"
          title="About"
          description=""
          align="center"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Story: Chinese + English -->
      <div class="about-story reveal reveal-delay-1">

        <p class="about-cn">
          Yuezi 与艺术的缘分，始于童年的涂鸦时光。那时画笔于她，不过是一件寻常玩具，尚未叩响心底的那扇门。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          Yuezi's connection with art began in childhood doodles. Back then, the brush was merely a toy — it had not yet knocked on the door within.
        </p>

        <p class="about-cn">
          大学专业并非美术。在故纸堆与旧时光中穿行，渐渐明白——人类最动人的故事，往往藏在细节的褶皱里。而真正心潮澎湃的，却是画布上那些无需言语的诉说。自己对色彩与线条的迷恋，远比想象中更深。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          Her university major was not fine arts. Wandering through archives and bygone eras, she came to understand something profound: humanity's most moving stories are often hidden in the creases of detail. Yet what truly stirred her was the wordless language of canvas. Her fascination with colour and line ran far deeper than she had imagined.
        </p>

        <p class="about-cn">
          于是她做了个勇敢的决定：正式进行美术学习，探索更多可能。那段全力以赴的时光并非徒劳——在持续的练习中，她系统锤炼了审美眼光，也学会了用更敏锐的方式观看世界：看清晨的光如何在叶尖流转，读懂人物眉宇间一闪而过的情绪。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          So she made a courageous decision: to pursue formal art training and keep exploring new possibilities. Those days of wholehearted effort were far from wasted — through sustained practice, she honed her aesthetic sensibility and learned to see the world with sharper eyes: how morning light moves across a leaf, how a fleeting emotion passes across a brow.
        </p>

        <p class="about-cn">
          这段经历让她明白，有些事情的意义不在于抵达，而在于行走本身。如今的她，不再执着于某个既定的终点，而是更珍视过程中的每一份感受与沉淀。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          This experience taught her that the meaning of some things lies not in arrival, but in the walk itself. Today, she no longer clings to a fixed destination, but treasures every feeling and every sedimentation along the way.
        </p>

        <p class="about-cn">
          生活从不缺少美，缺少的是停下来凝视的耐心。她带着历史的厚重与美术的轻盈，在寻常日子里打捞闪光碎片，用画笔记录当下最真实的震颤。细腻、坚韧、敏感——这些特质让她在创作中不断生长，也让她在人生的旅途上，步履不停。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          Life is never short of beauty — only of the patience to pause and behold it. Carrying the weight of history and the lightness of art, she gathers fragments of light from ordinary days, capturing with her brush the truest tremors of the present. Delicate, resilient, perceptive — these qualities allow her to keep growing through creation, and to keep moving, step by step, on the journey of life.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Philosophy Section -->
      <hr class="divider reveal" />

      <div class="reveal">
        <SectionTitle
          label="Philosophy"
          title="创作理念"
          description=""
          align="center"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="about-philosophy reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="about-cn about-philosophy-text">
          感受即灵感，日常即素材。在喧嚣中保持沉静，在细微处发现广阔，用绘画安放每一刻真实的触动。
        </p>
        <p class="about-en">
          Feeling is inspiration; the everyday is material. Stay still amid the noise, discover vastness in the minute, and let painting hold every moment of genuine emotion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <hr class="divider reveal" />

      <div class="reveal">
        <SectionTitle
          label="Contact"
          title="联系方式"
          description=""
          align="center"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="about-contact reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="about-text about-contact-text">
          欢迎交流与合作 / For inquiries and collaboration
        </p>
        <div class="contact-placeholder">
          <span class="contact-label">Email</span>
          <span class="contact-value text-muted">hello@yuezigallery.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-placeholder">
          <span class="contact-label">Studio</span>
          <span class="contact-value text-muted">Chengdu, China</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-4xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-5xl);
  }

  /* Avatar */
  .about-avatar-wrapper {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-3xl);
  }

  .about-avatar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Bilingual story text */
  .about-story {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3xl);
  }

  .about-cn {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .about-en {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Philosophy */
  .about-philosophy {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3xl);
  }

  .about-philosophy-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .about-philosophy .about-en {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Contact */
  .about-contact {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-contact-text {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .contact-placeholder {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .contact-label {
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text);
    min-width: 60px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .contact-value {
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-cn {
      font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    }
    .about-en {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    }
    .about-philosophy-text {
      font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    }
  }
</style>
